<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>VO2max 3x4min 30/30s v1</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Normal meal ~2h before. One bottle, 40-50g carbs. Done.

3x 4x (30sec @ 150% / 30sec @ 60%) w/5min reco
--
30/30s target both your Anaerobic and VO2 Max power. These over/under efforts allow to recover from the high-power surges, while also stressing your VO2 Max system due to the short recoveries. The intensity of this session is very high, but each interval will go by quickly.

RPE guide: 150% FTP -> RPE 8-9; 90% FTP -> RPE 6-7; 80% FTP -> RPE 5-6; 70% FTP -> RPE 3; 60% FTP -> RPE 3; 55% FTP -> RPE 3; 45% FTP -> RPE 3</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <SteadyState Duration="600" Power="0.60"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="180" Power="0.70"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="180" Power="0.80"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="180" Power="0.90"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.55"/>
    <IntervalsT Repeat="4" OnDuration="30" OnPower="1.50" OffDuration="30" OffPower="0.60"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.55"/>
    <IntervalsT Repeat="4" OnDuration="30" OnPower="1.50" OffDuration="30" OffPower="0.60"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.55"/>
    <IntervalsT Repeat="4" OnDuration="30" OnPower="1.50" OffDuration="30" OffPower="0.60"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="180" Power="0.45"/>
    <Cooldown Duration="660" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.50"/>
  </workout>
</workout_file>